{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-69",
  "title": "Integrations",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Integrations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:** Cablecast provides tools for managing broadcast schedules, video-on-demand, and live streaming for public access TV channels."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage in Docket:** Docket integrates with Cablecast to sync program schedules, manage video playback, and enable real-time updates to channel lineups. Users can directly import video files and schedule broadcasts through Docket's dashboard, streamlining station management."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:** Nexudus is a platform for coworking spaces and membership management."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage in Docket:** Docket connects with Nexudus to streamline user onboarding, track member activity, and manage shared resources. For public access TV, this includes validating user memberships, scheduling studio bookings, and tracking compliance with orientation requirements."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:** Vimeo is a video hosting and sharing platform with professional-grade features."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage in Docket:** Users can upload and manage their video content directly from Docket to Vimeo, enabling seamless hosting and sharing. Vimeo integration ensures that videos maintain high-quality streaming for viewers while centralizing access in Docket's media library."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:** YouTube is the world’s largest video-sharing platform."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage in Docket:** Docket enables direct publishing to YouTube from its dashboard, allowing users to extend their video content reach. Integration supports uploading videos, managing metadata (titles, descriptions, tags), and tracking YouTube analytics within Docket."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:** Twitch is a live-streaming platform primarily focused on gaming, events, and creative content."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage in Docket:** Users can schedule and broadcast live streams directly to Twitch via Docket's interface. This integration is ideal for live shows, community events, and interactive programming, syncing live content with on-demand archives."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:** Dropbox is a cloud storage platform for file sharing and collaboration."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage in Docket:** Docket integrates with Dropbox to allow users to upload media files, access shared resources, and manage program content. Producers can link Dropbox folders to Docket projects, ensuring files are always accessible and up-to-date."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:** Notion is an all-in-one workspace for notes, tasks, and databases."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage in Docket:** Notion integration supports collaborative production workflows, allowing users to link project documentation, manage task lists, and track deadlines within Docket. Producers can embed or sync Notion pages directly for a unified workflow."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:** GitHub is a platform for version control and collaboration on code repositories."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage in Docket:** GitHub integration allows developers to manage Docket's backend or client projects directly. For teams building plugins or custom features, Docket can link to relevant repositories, track pull requests, and monitor issues."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:** Slack is a messaging platform for team communication and collaboration."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage in Docket:** Users receive real-time updates on production statuses, scheduling conflicts, or team assignments via Slack channels. Notifications for new video uploads, schedule changes, or team discussions keep workflows seamless and coordinated."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Description:** Linear is a project management tool focused on issue tracking and team productivity."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Usage in Docket:** Linear integration helps teams manage production tasks, track bugs, and plan feature development. Producers can assign tasks, track progress, and view deadlines directly within Docket, bridging operational and technical workflows."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}